{{Short description|Genus of ferns}} {{Automatic taxobox | name = Beech ferns | image = Phegopteris_hexagonoptera1.JPG | image_caption = ''[[Phegopteris hexagonoptera]]'' in spring | taxon = Phegopteris | authority = (C.Presl) Fée<ref name=POWO_30000947-2/> | subdivision_ranks = Species | subdivision = [[#Species|See text]]. | synonyms = {{Genus list |Lastrella|(H.Itô) Nakai |Thelypteris subg. Phegopteris|(C.Presl) Ching }} | synonyms_ref = <ref name=POWO_30000947-2/><ref name=CFLW/> }}
'''''Phegopteris''''' is a [[genus]] of [[fern]]s in the family [[Thelypteridaceae]], subfamily Phegopteridoideae, in the [[Pteridophyte Phylogeny Group]] classification of 2016 (PPG I).<ref name=PPGI/> They are known collectively as the '''beech ferns'''. Species are native to Asia, North America and Europe.<ref name=CFLW/>
==Taxonomy== ''Phegopteris'' was first described in 1852 by [[Carl Borivoj Presl]] as an unranked taxon within the genus ''[[Polypodium]]''. It was raised to the rank of genus by [[Antoine Laurent Apollinaire Fée|Antoine Fée]] in the same year.<ref name="IPNI_30000947-2">{{citation |title=''Phegopteris'' (C.Presl) Fée |work=[[International Plant Names Index|The International Plant Names Index]] |url=https://www.ipni.org/n/30000947-2 |access-date=2020-01-11 }}</ref>
The [[Pteridophyte Phylogeny Group]] classification of 2016 (PPG I) recognizes three genera in the subfamily Phegopteridoideae: ''[[Macrothelypteris]]'', ''Phegopteris'' and ''[[Pseudophegopteris]]''.<ref name=PPGI/> {{As of|2020|January}}, both the ''Checklist of Ferns and Lycophytes of the World'' and ''[[Plants of the World Online]]'' regarded ''Pseudophegopteris'' as a synonym of ''Phegopteris''.<ref name=CFLW/><ref name=POWO_30000947-2/>
===Species=== {{As of|2025|June}}, the ''Checklist of Ferns and Lycophytes of the World'' accepted the following species:<ref name=CFLW/> {{Div col|colwidth=24em}} *''[[Phegopteris connectilis]]'' <small>(Michx.) Watt</small> *''[[Phegopteris decursive-pinnata]]'' <small>(H.C.Hall) Fée</small> *''[[Phegopteris excelsior]]'' <small>N.R.Patel & A.V.Gilman</small> *''[[Phegopteris hexagonoptera]]'' <small>(Michx.) Fée</small> *''[[Phegopteris koreana]]'' <small>B.Y.Sun & C.H.Kim</small> *''[[Phegopteris taiwaniana]]'' <small>T.Fujiw., Ogiso & Seriz.</small> {{Div col end}}
''[[Plants of the World Online]]'' listed further species which the ''Checklist of Ferns and Lycophytes of the World'' treats in ''[[Pseudophegopteris]]''<ref name=POWO_30000947-2/><ref name=CFLW/>
